	(text "CLASS II (DOUBLE INSULATED) - PLASTIC ENCLOSURE, NO PROTECTIVE EARTH.\nU1 IRM-03-5 is an isolated 2-wire module with no FG pin; there is no exposed\nconductive part requiring protective bonding. J3.3 (PE) is an ISOLATED\nPASS-THROUGH terminal provided so the installer can land the incoming\nearth conductor. It is NOT a protective earth for this device and must\nNOT be bonded to GND. C18 is a DNP functional-earth option: fit only if\nEMC pre-compliance shows a common-mode problem. LAYOUT: keep the PE net\nat full mains clearance from L and N over its entire length."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 244 189 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
